<h2>Starting soon</h2>
<p>The grid, a vignette, the announcement card wide with the countdown in pixel type, the handles at the foot, the visualiser breathing.</p>
<div class="frame-preview" style="--fw: 1920; --fh: 1080"><iframe src="/frames/live-starting/" title="starting soon" loading="lazy"></iframe></div>
